#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:1
msgid "SAR Processing"
msgstr "SAR 处理"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:8
msgid ""
"Looking to combine SAR with a *different* sensor type (optical, DEM) rather "
"than multiple dates of SAR alone? See [Multi-Sensor "
"Pipelines](../multisensor.md) — flood mapping, vegetation disturbance, and "
"InSAR+optical fusion all live there."
msgstr ""
"想把 SAR 与*不同*类型的传感器（光学、DEM）结合，而不仅仅是多个日期的 SAR？请参见 "
"[多传感器流程](../multisensor.md)——洪水制图、植被扰动以及 InSAR+光学融合都在那里。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:14
msgid ""
"Speckle filtering, radiometric calibration, flood mapping, interferometric "
"coherence, and five standard end-to-end processing pipelines built on top of"
" them. These are from-scratch implementations, not wrappers around an "
"external SAR toolkit."
msgstr ""
"斑点滤波、辐射定标、洪水制图、干涉相干性，以及构建于其上的五条标准端到端处理流程。这些都是从零开始的实现，而不是对外部 SAR 工具包的封装。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:19
msgid "Two `SARProcessor` classes exist"
msgstr "存在两个 `SARProcessor` 类"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:22
msgid ""
"`client.sar` (from `PyGeoFetch()`) is "
"`pygeofetch.processing.sar.SARProcessor`. `from pygeofetch.sar import "
"SARProcessor` is a separate class (`pygeofetch.sar.processor.SARProcessor`) "
"with the same methods and its own implementation. They are not kept in sync:"
" for example, only the standalone class reads complex SLC input correctly "
"for `coherence()`."
msgstr ""
"`client.sar`（来自 `PyGeoFetch()`）是 "
"`pygeofetch.processing.sar.SARProcessor`。`from pygeofetch.sar import "
"SARProcessor` "
"则是另一个独立的类（`pygeofetch.sar.processor.SARProcessor`），方法相同，但有自己的实现。它们并不保持同步：例如，只有独立类才能在"
" `coherence()` 中正确读取复数 SLC 输入。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:28
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:30
msgid ""
"Radar imagery behaves differently from optical imagery. It is measured by "
"the satellite's own signal, so it works at night and through cloud, and it "
"responds to surface roughness, moisture and structure rather than colour. It"
" also carries speckle, a granular noise that comes from the way radar "
"returns add up, and that noise has to be reduced before the image can be "
"interpreted. The SAR tools in pygeofetch cover the standard first steps for "
"Sentinel-1 style data: speckle filtering, radiometric calibration, flood "
"mapping from backscatter, and interferometric coherence."
msgstr ""
"雷达影像的表现与光学影像不同。它由卫星自身发射的信号测量，因此在夜间和云层之下也能工作，并且响应的是地表粗糙度、湿度和结构，而不是颜色。它还带有斑点（speckle），这是一种颗粒状噪声，源于雷达回波叠加的方式，在解译影像之前必须先降低这种噪声。pygeofetch"
" 中的 SAR 工具涵盖了 Sentinel-1 类数据的标准初始步骤：斑点滤波、辐射定标、基于后向散射的洪水制图以及干涉相干性。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:32
msgid ""
"A typical flood workflow shows how the pieces fit. Despeckle the image with "
"a filter such as Lee, convert to decibels, and apply a threshold so that "
"smooth open water, which reflects the radar away from the sensor and appears"
" dark, is separated from land. If you also have an image from before the "
"event, change detection between the two dates is more reliable than a single"
" threshold because it ignores permanently dark surfaces. The five standard "
"pipelines further down chain these steps for common tasks, so you can run a "
"whole analysis with one call and still inspect the intermediate files."
msgstr ""
"一个典型的洪水处理流程展示了各部分如何配合。先用 Lee "
"等滤波器对影像去斑，转换为分贝，再应用阈值，将把雷达波反射离开传感器、因而呈暗色的平静开阔水面与陆地区分开来。如果你还有事件发生之前的影像，那么两个日期之间的变化检测比单一阈值更可靠，因为它会忽略永久呈暗色的地表。下文的五条标准流程把这些步骤串联起来以完成常见任务，因此你只需一次调用即可运行整个分析，同时仍可检查中间文件。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid ""
"Synthetic SAR scene before and after Lee filtering, and the resulting flood "
"mask"
msgstr "Lee 滤波前后的合成 SAR 场景，以及得到的洪水掩膜"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:37
msgid ""
"<span class=\"gf-tag synthetic\">Synthetic</span> A simulated radar scene "
"processed with `client.sar`. Left: raw backscatter with speckle. Centre: "
"after a Lee filter. Right: the flood mask from a -15 dB threshold. Real "
"scenes are noisier and less uniform, so choose the threshold by inspecting "
"your own data."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"gf-tag synthetic\">Synthetic</span> 使用 `client.sar` "
"处理的模拟雷达场景。左：含斑点的原始后向散射。中：经 Lee 滤波后。右：由 -15 dB "
"阈值得到的洪水掩膜。真实场景噪声更大、更不均匀，因此请通过检查你自己的数据来选择阈值。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:40
msgid "`client.sar`: the built-in processor"
msgstr "`client.sar`：内置处理器"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:53
msgid ""
"All four methods read via a block-by-block fallback, so they work directly "
"on tiled/COG/compressed GeoTIFFs without a full-scene decode crashing on "
"large files."
msgstr "四个方法都通过逐块读取的回退方式进行读取，因此可直接处理分块/COG/压缩的 GeoTIFF，不会因对大文件进行整景解码而崩溃。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:57
msgid "Despeckling"
msgstr "去斑"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "滤波器"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Real algorithm"
msgstr "实际算法"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "`\"lee\"` (default)"
msgstr "`\"lee\"`（默认）"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Classic adaptive Lee filter — local mean/variance weighting"
msgstr "经典自适应 Lee 滤波——基于局部均值/方差加权"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "`\"enhanced_lee\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Coefficient-of-variation-thresholded Lee, sharper edge preservation"
msgstr "基于变异系数阈值的 Lee 滤波，边缘保持更锐利"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "`\"frost\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Exponentially-weighted local averaging, adaptive to local CV"
msgstr "指数加权的局部平均，可自适应局部变异系数"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "`\"gamma\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Gamma-MAP-style adaptive filter"
msgstr "Gamma-MAP 风格的自适应滤波器"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "`\"boxcar\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:34
msgid "Plain uniform-window averaging (fastest, least edge-preserving)"
msgstr "简单的均匀窗口平均（最快，边缘保持能力最弱）"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:71
msgid ""
"`window` must be odd (default 5). `num_looks` affects the Lee/Gamma noise-"
"variance threshold — set it to the real number of looks in your input if "
"known; the default of 1 is conservative (least aggressive smoothing)."
msgstr ""
"`window` 必须为奇数（默认 5）。`num_looks` 影响 Lee/Gamma "
"噪声方差阈值——如果已知，请将其设为输入数据的真实视数；默认值 1 较为保守（平滑最不激进）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:76
msgid "Radiometric calibration"
msgstr "辐射定标"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:82
msgid ""
"Converts SAR digital numbers (DN) to backscatter coefficients: `sigma0 = DN²"
" / A²`."
msgstr "将 SAR 数字量化值（DN）转换为后向散射系数：`sigma0 = DN² / A²`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:87
msgid ""
"**Limitation.** The calibration constant `A` is fixed at `1.0` (identity). "
"It is not a per-scene calibration look-up table read from the Sentinel-1 "
"annotation XML, which absolute radiometric accuracy requires. `gamma0` and "
"`beta0` use a **fixed nominal incidence angle** (38°) rather than the per-"
"pixel local incidence angle from a DEM. This is adequate for *relative* "
"comparisons within one scene (flood detection and change detection, which is"
" what every pipeline below uses it for). It is **not** adequate for "
"absolute, cross-scene radiometric work. That would need the Sentinel-1 "
"calibration vectors and a terrain model."
msgstr ""
"**局限性。** 定标常数 `A` 固定为 `1.0`（恒等）。它不是从 Sentinel-1 标注 XML "
"中读取的逐景定标查找表，而绝对辐射精度需要这样的查找表。`gamma0` 和 `beta0` 使用**固定的名义入射角**（38°），而不是来自 DEM"
" "
"的逐像元局部入射角。这对于单景内的*相对*比较是足够的（洪水检测和变化检测，下文每条流程都是这样使用它的）。但对于绝对的、跨场景的辐射处理则**不够**，那需要"
" Sentinel-1 定标向量和地形模型。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:95
msgid "Flood mapping"
msgstr "洪水制图"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:104
msgid "Two modes:"
msgstr "两种模式："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:105
msgid ""
"**Simple threshold** (no `reference`): backscatter below `threshold` dB "
"flags water (open water is a near-specular reflector at typical incidence "
"angles, so it returns very little energy to the sensor)."
msgstr ""
"**简单阈值**（无 `reference`）：后向散射低于 `threshold` dB "
"的像元被标记为水体（在典型入射角下，开阔水面近似镜面反射体，因此返回给传感器的能量很少）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:108
msgid ""
"**Change detection** (`reference` given): compares pre/post-event "
"backscatter, sensitivity `abs(threshold * 0.5)`."
msgstr "**变化检测**（给定 `reference`）：比较事件前后的后向散射，灵敏度为 `abs(threshold * 0.5)`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:111
msgid "`detect_direction` matters more than it might look:"
msgstr "`detect_direction` 比看上去更重要："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "Detects"
msgstr "检测对象"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "Why"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "`\"decrease\"` (default)"
msgstr "`\"decrease\"`（默认）"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "Backscatter dropping"
msgstr "后向散射下降"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid ""
"The correct signature for **open water** — a newly-flooded field becomes a "
"smooth, near-specular surface"
msgstr "**开阔水面**的正确特征——新近被淹没的农田变成光滑的近镜面表面"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "`\"increase\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "Backscatter rising"
msgstr "后向散射上升"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid ""
"The correct signature for **flooded urban/built-up areas** — water at a "
"building's base creates a double-bounce (ground-wall-sensor) reflection "
"stronger than dry ground alone"
msgstr "**被淹没的城市/建成区**的正确特征——建筑物基部的积水会产生二面角（地面—墙体—传感器）反射，比单纯的干燥地面更强"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "`\"both\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid "Either direction"
msgstr "任一方向"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:85
msgid ""
"The robust choice when an AOI mixes open water and dense urban flooding — a "
"one-directional threshold **structurally cannot** detect the other pattern "
"at all, not just detect it poorly"
msgstr "当 AOI 中既有开阔水面又有密集城市内涝时，这是稳健的选择——单向阈值**在结构上完全无法**检测另一种模式，而不仅仅是检测效果差"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:119
msgid "flood_map() alone is not a complete workflow"
msgstr "仅有 flood_map() 并不是完整的工作流"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:122
msgid ""
"Calling `flood_map()` directly on raw DN values gives poor, unreliable "
"results — its dB-scale threshold assumes calibrated input. See "
"[`flood_mapping_pipeline`](#flood_mapping_pipeline) below, which handles the"
" prerequisite chain for you."
msgstr ""
"直接对原始 DN 值调用 `flood_map()` 会得到较差且不可靠的结果——它的 dB 刻度阈值假定输入已经过定标。请参见下文的 "
"[`flood_mapping_pipeline`](#flood_mapping_pipeline)，它会为你处理所需的前置步骤链。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:127
msgid "Interferometric coherence"
msgstr "干涉相干性"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:133
msgid ""
"Formula: `coherence = |<s1·conj(s2)>| / sqrt(<|s1|^2><|s2|^2>)`, range `[0, "
"1]`. Both inputs must be **co-registered complex SLC** rasters (`complex64` "
"GeoTIFFs). High coherence indicates a stable surface between the two "
"acquisition dates; low coherence indicates change or temporal decorrelation "
"(vegetation growth, surface disturbance, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"公式：`coherence = |<s1·conj(s2)>| / sqrt(<|s1|^2><|s2|^2>)`，取值范围 `[0, "
"1]`。两个输入都必须是**已配准的复数 SLC** 栅格（`complex64` "
"GeoTIFF）。高相干性表示两个采集日期之间地表保持稳定；低相干性表示发生了变化或时间去相干（植被生长、地表扰动等）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:140
msgid "`client.sar.coherence()` fails on complex SLC input"
msgstr "`client.sar.coherence()` 在复数 SLC 输入上会失败"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:143
msgid ""
"In the current code, `client.sar.coherence()` (and therefore `pygeofetch sar"
" coherence`) reads complex bands through a shared loader that casts to real "
"`float32`, discarding the phase, and then fails with `ValueError: cannot "
"reshape array of size ... into shape ...`. The same method on the standalone"
" class, `pygeofetch.sar.SARProcessor`, reads complex bands directly with "
"`rasterio` and works. Until `client.sar` is fixed, use the standalone class "
"for coherence:"
msgstr ""
"在当前代码中，`client.sar.coherence()`（因此也包括 `pygeofetch sar "
"coherence`）通过一个共享加载器读取复数波段，该加载器会将其转换为实数 `float32`，丢弃相位，随后以 `ValueError: "
"cannot reshape array of size ... into shape ...` 失败。独立类 "
"`pygeofetch.sar.SARProcessor` 上的同名方法则直接使用 `rasterio` 读取复数波段，可以正常工作。在 "
"`client.sar` 修复之前，请使用独立类来计算相干性："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:155
msgid ""
"The coherence formula itself lives in "
"`pygeofetch.utils.sar_math.estimate_interferometric_coherence` and is shared"
" by the standalone class and the multi-sensor vegetation-disturbance "
"pipeline. See [Known issues](../../reference/known-issues.md#sar-coherence-"
"fails-on-complex-input)."
msgstr ""
"相干性公式本身位于 "
"`pygeofetch.utils.sar_math.estimate_interferometric_coherence`，由独立类和多传感器植被扰动流程共用。参见"
" [已知问题](../../reference/known-issues.md#sar-coherence-fails-on-complex-"
"input)。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:160
msgid "Five standard SAR processing pipelines"
msgstr "五条标准 SAR 处理流程"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:162
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch.sar.pipelines` orchestrates the atomic operations above into "
"five widely-used end-to-end workflows — because remembering and correctly "
"ordering the prerequisite steps each analysis actually needs is easy to get "
"wrong (e.g. flood mapping on raw, uncalibrated DN gives poor results, a "
"common mistake)."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch.sar.pipelines` "
"将上述原子操作编排为五条广泛使用的端到端工作流——因为要记住并正确排列每种分析实际所需的前置步骤很容易出错（例如，对未经定标的原始 DN "
"进行洪水制图会得到较差的结果，这是一个常见的错误）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:168
msgid ""
"Every pipeline takes a `pygeofetch.sar.SARProcessor` instance (the "
"standalone class, not `client.sar`)."
msgstr "每条流程都接受一个 `pygeofetch.sar.SARProcessor` 实例（即独立类，而不是 `client.sar`）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:184
msgid ""
"Every pipeline returns a `PipelineResult`: `success`, `final_output`, "
"`stages` (every intermediate `ProcessingResult`, not just the final one — "
"useful for inspecting exactly what each step produced), and `metadata` "
"(pipeline-specific extras, like a change mask path or pixel counts)."
msgstr ""
"每条流程都返回一个 `PipelineResult`：`success`、`final_output`、`stages`（每个中间 "
"`ProcessingResult`，而不仅仅是最终结果——便于精确检查每一步产生了什么），以及 "
"`metadata`（流程特有的附加信息，如变化掩膜路径或像元计数）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:190
msgid "`standard_grd_preprocessing_pipeline`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:192
msgid ""
"The standard Sentinel-1 GRD chain nearly every SAR analysis starts with: "
"calibrate (DN → sigma0/gamma0/beta0), then despeckle — in that order, not "
"the reverse. Despeckling raw, uncalibrated DN conflates backscatter with the"
" sensor's raw digital-number scaling, and filtering in dB space (calibrate's"
" default) is standard practice since speckle noise behaves closer to "
"additive once log-converted, which Lee/boxcar-style filters (designed for "
"additive noise) handle better."
msgstr ""
"几乎所有 SAR 分析都以此开始的标准 Sentinel-1 GRD 处理链：先定标（DN → "
"sigma0/gamma0/beta0），再去斑——顺序不能颠倒。对未经定标的原始 DN 去斑，会把后向散射与传感器原始数字量化值的缩放混在一起；而在 "
"dB 空间中滤波（定标的默认设置）是标准做法，因为斑点噪声在取对数后更接近加性噪声，而 Lee/boxcar "
"类滤波器（针对加性噪声设计）能更好地处理这种噪声。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:208
msgid "`flood_mapping_pipeline`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:210
msgid ""
"Calibrates and despeckles the flood-event image (and a pre-event reference, "
"if doing change-based detection) before running `flood_map()` — enforcing "
"the prerequisite chain rather than leaving it to the caller."
msgstr ""
"在运行 `flood_map()` "
"之前，先对洪水事件影像（以及事件前参考影像，如果进行基于变化的检测）进行定标和去斑——强制执行前置步骤链，而不是留给调用者自己处理。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:223
msgid "`change_detection_pipeline`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:225
msgid ""
"standard bi-temporal amplitude change detection: calibrate and despeckle "
"both dates, then flag pixels whose backscatter changed by more than "
"`change_threshold_db`. Since both calibrated rasters are already in dB, the "
"log-ratio change metric reduces to a simple subtraction (`post_dB - pre_dB`)"
" — standard math, not an approximation."
msgstr ""
"标准的双时相振幅变化检测：对两个日期都进行定标和去斑，然后标记后向散射变化超过 `change_threshold_db` "
"的像元。由于两幅定标后的栅格都已处于 dB 单位，对数比变化度量就简化为一次减法（`post_dB - pre_dB`）——这是标准数学，而不是近似。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:232
msgid ""
"General-purpose beyond flood mapping: burn-scar mapping, deforestation and "
"clear-cut detection, construction/urban change, and disaster damage "
"assessment (collapsed structures show a sharp backscatter change)."
msgstr "适用范围不限于洪水制图：火烧迹地制图、森林砍伐和皆伐检测、建设/城市变化，以及灾害损失评估（倒塌的建筑会表现出明显的后向散射变化）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:243
msgid "`coherence_disturbance_pipeline`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:245
msgid ""
"Computes interferometric coherence between two co-registered SLC "
"acquisitions, then flags low-coherence pixels as a disturbance mask. "
"Complementary to `change_detection_pipeline` above: that one needs GRD "
"(amplitude) data and detects backscatter magnitude change; this one needs "
"SLC (phase-preserving) data and detects phase-stability loss. common uses: "
"deforestation and selective logging (vegetation disturbance decorrelates "
"radar phase almost immediately), and general surface disturbance monitoring."
msgstr ""
"计算两个已配准 SLC 采集之间的干涉相干性，然后将低相干像元标记为扰动掩膜。与上文的 `change_detection_pipeline` "
"互补：那条流程需要 GRD（振幅）数据并检测后向散射幅度变化；这条流程需要 "
"SLC（保留相位）数据并检测相位稳定性的丧失。常见用途：森林砍伐和选择性采伐（植被扰动几乎会立即使雷达相位去相干），以及一般性的地表扰动监测。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:260
msgid "`bright_target_detection_pipeline`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:262
msgid ""
"standard CA-CFAR (cell-averaging Constant False Alarm Rate) bright-target "
"detection: calibrate — but deliberately **do not despeckle**, since speckle "
"filtering would smooth away exactly the small, bright targets this pipeline "
"looks for — then flag pixels significantly brighter than their local "
"background, estimated from a annulus of pixels between a guard window and a "
"larger background window (excluding the guard region so a target's own "
"bright halo doesn't inflate its own background estimate)."
msgstr ""
"标准的 CA-"
"CFAR（单元平均恒虚警率）亮目标检测：先定标——但有意**不去斑**，因为斑点滤波会恰好抹平这条流程所要寻找的小而亮的目标——然后标记明显亮于其局部背景的像元，背景由保护窗口与更大背景窗口之间的环形像元估计（排除保护区域，这样目标自身的亮晕不会抬高它自己的背景估计）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:271
msgid ""
"common uses: ship/vessel detection (maritime surveillance, illegal fishing "
"monitoring), and more generally any small, strongly radar-reflective object "
"against a comparatively uniform background (metal structures, vehicles, "
"equipment) — a real, complementary technique to optical detection for "
"conditions optical can't cover: cloud cover and night-time passes."
msgstr ""
"常见用途：舰船检测（海上监视、非法捕捞监测），以及更广泛地说，在相对均匀的背景上任何小而具有强雷达反射性的物体（金属结构、车辆、设备）——对于光学无法覆盖的条件（云层覆盖和夜间过境），这是对光学检测真实且互补的技术。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:287
msgid "The standalone `pygeofetch.sar.SARProcessor`"
msgstr "独立的 `pygeofetch.sar.SARProcessor`"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:298
msgid ""
"`SARProcessor` has the same methods as `client.sar` (`despeckle`, "
"`calibrate`, `flood_map`, `coherence`) and is what the five pipelines above "
"expect."
msgstr ""
"`SARProcessor` 具有与 `client.sar` "
"相同的方法（`despeckle`、`calibrate`、`flood_map`、`coherence`），并且是上述五条流程所需要的类。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:301
msgid "The `backend=` parameter is not implemented"
msgstr "`backend=` 参数尚未实现"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/sar.md:304
msgid ""
"The `pygeofetch.sar` module docstring and the `sar` and `ost` extras "
"describe a pluggable backend: `SARProcessor(backend=\"sarxarray\")` or "
"`SARProcessor(backend=\"ost\")`. In the current code `SARProcessor` has no "
"`__init__`, so `SARProcessor(backend=\"sarxarray\")` raises `TypeError: "
"SARProcessor() takes no arguments`. The helper modules "
"`pygeofetch/sar/_native.py`, `_sarxarray.py` and `_ost.py` exist but nothing"
" imports them. Terrain correction (`terrain_correct`) and the `sarxarray` "
"workflow are therefore not reachable through the public API. See [Known "
"issues](../../reference/known-issues.md#sar-backends-are-not-wired-in)."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch.sar` 模块的文档字符串以及 `sar` 和 `ost` "
"额外依赖项描述了一种可插拔后端：`SARProcessor(backend=\"sarxarray\")` 或 "
"`SARProcessor(backend=\"ost\")`。在当前代码中，`SARProcessor` 没有 `__init__`，因此 "
"`SARProcessor(backend=\"sarxarray\")` 会抛出 `TypeError: SARProcessor() takes "
"no arguments`。辅助模块 `pygeofetch/sar/_native.py`、`_sarxarray.py` 和 `_ost.py` "
"存在，但没有任何地方导入它们。因此，地形校正（`terrain_correct`）和 `sarxarray` 工作流无法通过公共 API 访问。参见 "
"[已知问题](../../reference/known-issues.md#sar-backends-are-not-wired-in)。"
